Opt-in per application: a generic build carries this adapter (when
TOLKARA_EXPERIMENTAL_ADAPTERS names GameController) but the runtime uses it only
for an application whose profile sets TOLKARA_ADAPTERS to include GameController,
today Cyberpunk 2077. Every other application, World of Warcraft among them,
links the iOS GameController framework and sees real controllers, which the
WoW clients read through their bundled SDL (its GameController backend).
A build made for one executable (with a library map) ignores this marker.
